# Steamcore Scholar: when it enters you draw two cards, then discard two cards unless you discard an instant or sorcery
# card or a creature card with flying. Lightning Bolt in hand after the draw makes the one-card discard available;
# the player takes it and chooses the Bolt. The Island is not an eligible card for it (refusal beside the positive choice).

